            "preview": "// A custom \"?:\" delimiter is recognized just like the default. sub = new StrSubstitutor(map, PREFIX, SUFFIX, ESCAPE, \"?:\"); assertEquals(RESOLVED_WITH_DEFAULT, sub.replace(templateWithDelimiter(\"?:\")));"
