            "preview": "// A custom \"||\" delimiter is recognized. sub = new StrSubstitutor(map, PREFIX, SUFFIX, ESCAPE, \"||\"); assertEquals(RESOLVED_WITH_DEFAULT, sub.replace(templateWithDelimiter(\"||\")));"
