            "preview": "// A single-character \"!\" delimiter is recognized. sub = new StrSubstitutor(map, PREFIX, SUFFIX, ESCAPE, \"!\"); assertEquals(RESOLVED_WITH_DEFAULT, sub.replace(templateWithDelimiter(\"!\")));"
